KUNALI DAHIKAR — PORTFOLIO WEBSITE
===================================
HOW TO OPEN
  Double-click index.html (works offline; fonts need internet).

HOW TO EDIT
  All content (text, marks, skills, projects, certificates, gallery captions, links)
  lives in  js/data.js  — change it there and refresh the page.
  Images are in  assets/img/  ; the resume PDF is  assets/Kunali_Dahikar_Resume.pdf

HOW TO PUBLISH FREE
  GitHub Pages: create a repo, upload all files, Settings > Pages > deploy from main.
  Or drag the whole folder onto netlify.com/drop  or  vercel.com.

FILES
  index.html      page structure
  css/style.css   design, dark/light theme, animations
  js/data.js      YOUR CONTENT (edit this)
  js/main.js      interactivity (typing effect, tabs, filters, lightbox, animations)
